://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:QL%20(Deprecated)","name":"Team:QL (Deprecated)","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"Meta label for query languages team"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2021-12-08T09:39:44Z","updated_at":"2021-12-13T08:29:21Z","closed_at":"2021-12-13T08:29:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The following query increases the `rest.total` counter by 11 and the `rest.paging` counter by 10 (as returned by `_sql/stats`):\r\n\r\n```\r\nGET http://localhost:9201/_sql\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"fetch_size\": 10,\r\n  \"query\": \"select last_name, sum(languages) from test_emp group by 1 order by 2\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nExpected behavior would be to only increase `rest.total` by 1.\r\n\r\nThe bug is caused by `LocalAggregationSorterListener` using `PlanExecutor` to fetch all records before sorting.","closed_by":{"login":"Luegg","id":1016746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTY3NDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1016746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg","html_url":"https://github.com/Luegg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Luegg/received_events","type":"Use